# Ultima's attack trigger puts a blight counter on target land, which for as long as it has it loses all land types and
# abilities and has "{T}: Add {C}" (CR 611.2b, 305.7, 613.1d, 613.1f). Bot1's blighted Forest is no longer a Forest (no type,
# no {G}), taps for {C}, and "whenever you tap a land for {C}, add an additional {C}" makes it {C}{C}. A Mountain, tapped for {R},
# is not doubled. Cast turn 1 (Mox Ruby, Sol Ring from the Mox, Black Lotus for {3}, Sol Ring {2}), the attack is on turn 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Black Lotus
Ultima, Origin of Oblivion
Forest
Mountain
Forest
Mountain
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

